  "certified_type": {
    "category": "Checkweigher",
    "type_designations": ["CW3"],
    "module_designation": "Not applicable",
    "description": "Automatic catchweighing instrument designated CW3, operating as an automatic checkweigher (Category X). The instrument comprises a cabinet with user interface, weighing device, mechanical handling facilities and reject device, and is designed to weigh packs dynamically. Constructed in stainless steel: a fabricated floor-standing frame on adjustable feet carries the modular conveyor sections (in-feed, weigh platform, out-feed) and the main cabinet with console; the out-feed conveyor can be equipped with one of a number of reject devices. The load transport system may consist of conveyor belts driven by rollers or by sets of chains (Drag Link). Permanently installed. Control cabinet at the front houses the electrical hardware; console above it contains keyboard and touch-screen display; photocells at either end and either side of the conveyor are used for pack detection."
